for customers.

00:04:14.887 --> 00:04:20.059 line:0%
[ Laughter ]
-[ Clapping ]

00:04:20.059 --> 00:04:21.860 line:0%
-Yes!
-For customers who drink

00:04:21.860 --> 00:04:23.496 line:0%
iced coffee in the winter.

00:04:23.496 --> 00:04:24.997 line:0%
Look at that thing again.
Look at that.

00:04:24.997 --> 00:04:27.433 line:0%
[ Laughter ]
Look at that.

00:04:27.433 --> 00:04:29.234 line:0%
Actually, I think the gloves
are going to be a huge hit.

00:04:29.234 --> 00:04:31.537
Check out who I saw
wearing them today.

00:04:31.537 --> 00:04:32.671
There you go.

00:04:32.671 --> 00:04:34.740
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:34.740 --> 00:04:37.510
He had a double loaf.

00:04:37.510 --> 00:04:39.678
Have you guys seen
the slow Zoom interviews

00:04:39.678 --> 00:04:41.681
that Vanity Fair does?

00:04:41.681 --> 00:04:43.348
They ask celebrities
personal questions

00:04:43.348 --> 00:04:46.119
