gets closer to their face.

00:04:46.119 --> 00:04:48.454
They've done it
with RuPaul, Tyra Banks.

00:04:48.454 --> 00:04:49.855
They just did one
with Billie Eilish.

00:04:49.855 --> 00:04:52.558
And I actually
did one, too, but,

00:04:52.558 --> 00:04:54.660
