a fast Zoom, instead.

00:04:54.660 --> 00:04:56.629 line:0%
Here, take a look.

00:04:56.629 --> 00:04:58.530 line:0%
-Fast Zoom interview
with Jimmy Fallon.

00:04:58.530 --> 00:05:00.032 line:0%
Take 1.
[ Clack ]

00:05:00.032 --> 00:05:02.634 line:0%
-What's your favorite
brand of toothpaste?

00:05:02.634 --> 00:05:04.337 line:0%
-Um, gosh.

00:05:04.337 --> 00:05:06.906 line:0%
