00:05:06.906 --> 00:05:08.441 line:0%
Crest?
[ Beep, clack ]

00:05:08.441 --> 00:05:10.042
-What's your favorite
late night snack?

00:05:10.042 --> 00:05:11.744
-Probably, uh --

00:05:11.744 --> 00:05:14.179
it's probably frozen pizza,
probably frozen pizza.

00:05:14.179 --> 00:05:15.848
[ Laughter ]
-What's your favorite
ice cream flavor?

00:05:15.848 --> 00:05:17.683
-I like mint chocolate chip.

00:05:17.683 --> 00:05:18.817
-What kind of sandwiches
do you like?

00:05:18.817 --> 00:05:20.386
-Hey, get -- This is how
the interview goes?

00:05:20.386 --> 00:05:21.587 line:0%
[ Laughter ]
[ Beep, clack ]

00:05:21.587 --> 00:05:22.889
Hey, is my publicist here?

00:05:22.889 --> 00:05:24.289
[ Laughter ]

00:05:24.289 --> 00:05:25.724
Is this --
No, no, I don't want to do --

00:05:25.724 --> 00:05:27.493
[ Laughter ]
[ Bleep ]

00:05:27.493 --> 00:05:29.595
