00:06:26.552 --> 00:06:30.356
[ Cheering, whistling,
and applause ]

00:06:30.356 --> 00:06:32.525
And we're very excited
about this.

00:06:32.525 --> 00:06:34.293
This is -- Oh, look at this.

00:06:34.293 --> 00:06:35.728
Pink vinyl.
[ Audience murmuring ]

00:06:35.728 --> 00:06:38.631
"Ooh la la, Sasson."

00:06:38.631 --> 00:06:41.900
This is the song that I heard

00:06:41.900 --> 00:06:44.903
in a hardware store

00:06:44.903 --> 00:06:47.373
in quarantine, my first trip
out in quarantine.

00:06:47.373 --> 00:06:49.875
I went to the hardware store
and I heard the song

00:06:49.875 --> 00:06:51.176
and it sounded like

00:06:51.176 --> 00:06:54.346
a George Harrison type of vibe
or something to it.

00:06:54.346 --> 00:06:57.150
And I just Shazam'd it
and I go, "What is this?"

00:06:57.150 --> 00:06:58.684
Swingin'.

00:06:58.684 --> 00:07:00.419
If we're going to go down,
we're going to go down swinging.

00:07:00.419 --> 00:07:01.954
It is so good.

00:07:01.954 --> 00:07:03.255
♪ 'Cause if we go ♪

00:07:03.255 --> 00:07:04.857
Let me just play a little
because you're going to --

00:07:04.857 --> 00:07:06.959
Already, just crank up
your TVs already.

00:07:06.959 --> 00:07:10.429
Say about one 130,
get in there, 120?

00:07:10.429 --> 00:07:11.564
♪♪

00:07:11.564 --> 00:07:12.665
Oh, no, no.
Earlier.

00:07:12.665 --> 00:07:14.099
-♪ End that way ♪
-Here we go.

00:07:14.099 --> 00:07:18.504
-♪ Just stay ♪
-Here we go. 1, 2, 3.

00:07:18.504 --> 00:07:20.906
-♪ If I'm gonna go down ♪

00:07:20.906 --> 00:07:24.977
♪ I wanna go down swingin' ♪

00:07:24.977 --> 00:07:27.312
♪ I wanna go down hard ♪

00:07:27.312 --> 00:07:29.415
-I mean, dude, he hit the notes
and everything. I was like --

00:07:29.415 --> 00:07:32.484
♪ Wah da dee ♪

00:07:32.484 --> 00:07:34.520
And I was just doing that
in the hardware store.

00:07:34.520 --> 00:07:37.689
[ Laughter ]
♪ I wanna go down ♪

00:07:37.689 --> 00:07:39.258
I should've been
in the hammer section.

00:07:39.258 --> 00:07:40.359
-Yeah.
-You know?

00:07:40.359 --> 00:07:42.894
[ Laughter ]
But I wasn't.

00:07:42.894 --> 00:07:44.863
I was in the --

00:07:44.863 --> 00:07:46.798
I was in the screwdriver/
light switch section.

00:07:46.798 --> 00:07:48.500
[ Laughter ]
-Yeah.

00:07:48.500 --> 00:07:49.635
-I don't really know
my way around.

00:07:49.635 --> 00:07:50.903
-I was wondering what you were

00:07:50.903 --> 00:07:52.704
doing in the hardware store.

00:07:52.704 --> 00:07:53.972
[ Laughter ]
-What do you mean,

00:07:53.972 --> 00:07:55.074
what I was doing
in the hardware store?

00:07:55.074 --> 00:07:57.209
I'm doing what any
-You just needed --

00:07:57.209 --> 00:07:59.245
-You needed someplace
-man of the house does.

00:07:59.245 --> 00:08:00.880
-to drive your truck to, just --

00:08:00.880 --> 00:08:02.314
[ Laughter ]

00:08:02.314 --> 00:08:04.917
-Well, my driver
took the truck there and...

00:08:04.917 --> 00:08:06.318
[ Laughter ]

00:08:06.318 --> 00:08:07.920
...I said, "Pierre,
you're going a little fast,

00:08:07.920 --> 00:08:10.589
[ Laughter ]
don't you think?"

00:08:10.589 --> 00:08:11.624
-French driver.
-I said, "Slow down."

00:08:11.624 --> 00:08:12.858
I have a French driver, yeah.

00:08:12.858 --> 00:08:14.960
[ Laughter ]

00:08:14.960 --> 00:08:15.961
I was like, "Slow down.

00:08:15.961 --> 00:08:18.163
You're making me a little sick.

00:08:18.163 --> 00:08:19.565
My caviar's about to come out."

00:08:19.565 --> 00:08:21.267
[ Laughter ]

00:08:21.267 --> 00:08:23.202
No, yeah, I took the truck.

00:08:23.202 --> 00:08:25.571
You know, I do like,
you know, like --

00:08:25.571 --> 00:08:27.606
you know, like you slide
into the window

00:08:27.606 --> 00:08:29.174
to get in the truck.

00:08:29.174 --> 00:08:31.310
-Yeah.
-Yeah. I go in through the roof,

00:08:31.310 --> 00:08:32.311
